[I tried this on March, 17 1993 and it didn't work - Carl]

For up-to-date and comprehensive congressional info via gopher, try:

gopher -p"waissrc:/.WAIS/congress.src" scilibx.ucsc.edu 70

The bookmark is:

Name=Congressional directory
Type=7
Port=70
Path=waissrc:/.WAIS/congress.src
Host=scilibx.ucsc.edu
